  "body": "These three files are referenced in \"`BOILERPLATE`\" comments (includes) in\nthe spec source but are actually temporary generated files output by the\nhtml-build script. So let's rename them with a leading dot both here and in\nhtml-build to mitigate clutter in the build directory while building.\n",
